<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Otis lifts half yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Otis lifts half yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended May 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		  30.4	  vs 28.1</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 20.0	  vs 18.0</p>
<p>    Net income		6.21	  vs 5.74</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   11.31	 vs 10.45</p>
<p>    Tax			 5.10	  vs 4.71</p>
<p>    Interest received     0.10	  vs 0.70</p>
<p>    Turnover		  103.10	vs 96.39</p>
<p>Div payable July 25</p>
<p>on register July 11</p>
<p>Full name: Otis Elevator Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said that shareholders may expect continuing improvements in earnings for the second half.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
